    "created_at": "2025-06-02T19:55:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-02T19:55:18Z",
    "body": "Inconsistent is on-brand for HTML. 😉\n\nI think dashed names for attribute values are generally nicer, for future naming of tokens, but not worth changing something already shipped.",
